      {
        "question": "How do I name my makeup brand?",
        "answer": "Decide what the brand stands for first: playful (<em>Pout of Office</em>), minimal (<em>Kohl Cosmetics</em>), luxurious (<em>Delaunay Beauté</em>) or clean and natural. Founder names plus <em>Beauty</em> or <em>Cosmetics</em> are the most common shape and easy to protect. Cosmetics are trade mark class 3, a crowded class, so check the registers as well as domains and handles."
